  "title": "Red Broccoli Salad",
  "description": "This recipe calls for lots of crumbled, maple-flavored bacon, chopped broccoli, red and green onion, red grapes and toasted almonds. Everything is then tossed with a sweet mayonnaise and vinegar dressing.",
  "authors": [
    "MAGGIE MCGUIRE"
  ],
